ng that will cause them  access in the future so  it's more about practice than anything  else yeah they don't want to lose access  and i think that that is a big priority  for how corporate media handles  interviews with big politicians and and  bigger names and i think that that is  it's sort it's a false debate that was  mostly had around this it's not so much  about  whether to interview the extremists but  about how to interview them  interviewing them in and of itself isn't  what needs to be debated  how it should be done is the important  conversation and  a lot of bogus discussion centered  around this rally send me your thoughts  how do you define responsible  platforming i'm on twitter  deepakman and the show is on twitter at  davidpakmanshow  today's episode of the show is made  possible in part by filter  easy you can outsmart your chore list by  signing up for filter easy it's a  subscription service  that will make it impossible for you to  forget to change your air filters  because they arrive at your front door  when you need to change them as some of  you know i recently moved  and i had a list of about i don't know  100 to 150 things that had to be done  and one of them was figuring out  the right schedule for filter  replacements and now that i am signed up  with filter easy  i get the new filters on the schedule  that they need to be replaced at my  place  a lot of homeowners don't know how often  to change their air filters or they  forget and filter easy makes it  very very simple you can sign up in  under five minutes on your computer or  phone  it's extraordinarily easy and i am now  fully set up with filter easy and it's a  subscription for something you actually  need  versus lots of other things that you can  sign up for it's practical  it's really a no-brainer which is why i  sign up for it and for listeners and  viewers of the david pakman show  you can get your first order for free by  going to filtereasy.com  if you prefer to do it by 